-  "FINDING_gate_must_not_ship_without_mask": "The must-not-fire control is admitted MASK-ON on every seed and REJECTED MASK-OFF on every seed (change_fidelity 0.4694/0.4083/0.4103 < 0.5 on the whole dc22 corpus, reason change_fidelity_below_threshold). So the gate-only arm (A2) rejects the one engine known to be genuinely good, and CARNOT_ARC_WM_CHANGE_GATE must not be flipped without CARNOT_ARC_WM_HUD_MASK. The two flags are independent constants but NOT independent in the direction that matters for a ship decision.",
-  "FINDING_support_is_three_seeds_no_significance_claim_is_reachable": "The must-not-fire control and the no-op-hallucination arm are 3 matched seeds each. The minimum two-sided sign-test p at n=3 is 0.25, so NO result on these arms can be significant at any conventional level, and none is claimed. The 3/3 outcomes are reported as illustrative direction, not as established rates. Raising this above illustrative needs n>=10 (min p 0.00195), which is a separate run.",
