+    "not_measured_here": "The ACTUAL induce-call arrival concurrency across a multi-game run was NOT measured. Induce fires on stalls, not uniformly, so whether arrivals actually cluster past 16 is unknown. That measurement -- not a further n_ctx raise -- is the next step if the LLM tier is ever unblocked downstream. The lever if they do cluster is CARNOT_ARC_INDUCE_TIMEOUT or an explicit client-side admission cap, NOT more context.",
